@startuml UC4_AutoRecord_Updated
title UC4 - User automatically records bike trip
actor "Registered User" as User
participant "BBP System" as System
participant "Phone Sensors/GPS" as Sensors
participant "Weather Service" as Weather

autonumber
' Entry: User is on "New trip" page

User -> System: Clicks start automatic recording
activate System

alt Sensor Permissions Granted
    System -> Sensors: Start taking data (GPS)
    
    loop While Recording
        Sensors -> System: Stream Velocity/GPS Data
        System -> System: Recognize cycling (velocity > threshold)
        System -> System: Trace position & Detect obstacles
        
        alt Exception: GPS Signal Lost
             System -> User: Warning: GPS Signal Lost
        end
    end

    System -> System: Recognize user stopped cycling
    User -> System: User finishes automatic recording
    
    System -> User: Asks to confirm or correct recorded data
    User -> System: Optionally corrects data and clicks confirm
    
    ' Nuovo passaggio Meteo
    System -> Weather: Request weather data (Date/Location)
    activate Weather
    Weather --> System: Return meteorological info
    deactivate Weather
    System -> System: Adds meteorological info to trip

    System -> System: Calculates status based on data
    System -> User: Shows status
    
    User -> System: Inserts name and clicks "Save trip"

    alt User confirms save
        alt Name Unique
            System -> System: Saves trip
            System -> User: Informs user of outcome
            note right: Exit Condition: Recorded trip is saved
        else Exception: Duplicate Name
             System --> User: Error: Name already exists
        end
    else Exception: User discards recorded trip
        User -> System: Discards trip
        System -> System: Deletes temp data
    end

else Exception: Sensor permissions negated
    System --> User: Error: Permissions denied
end

deactivate System
@enduml